{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":48.380001068115234,"text":"The Archaeological Museum stops roughly where this one begins. The Historical Museum of Crete covers the 1600 years after the Minoans, early Christian, Byzantine, Venetian, Ottoman, and the 20th century. It was founded in 1953 in a mansion by the sea. Its best-known holding is two paintings by an artist born in Crete around 1541 and named Domenikos Theotokopoulos. He learned to paint icons, left for Venice, and ended up in Spain, where people simply called him the Greek, El Greco. These two are the only works of his anywhere in Crete. The museum also holds an enormous model of Heraklion as it was in the 17th century, and the study of Nikos Kazantzakis moved in exactly as it was.","words":[{"word":"The","start":0,"end":0.5199999809265137},{"word":"Archaeological","start":0.5199999809265137,"end":1.440000057220459},{"word":"Museum","start":1.440000057220459,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"stops","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":2.4600000381469727},{"word":"roughly","start":2.4600000381469727,"end":2.880000114440918},{"word":"where","start":2.880000114440918,"end":3.180000066757202},{"word":"this","start":3.180000066757202,"end":3.380000114440918},{"word":"one","start":3.380000114440918,"end":3.6600000858306885},{"word":"begins","start":3.6600000858306885,"end":4.059999942779541},{"word":"The","start":4.739999771118164,"end":4.78000020980835},{"word":"Historical","start":4.78000020980835,"end":5.420000076293945},{"word":"Museum","start":5.420000076293945,"end":5.760000228881836},{"word":"of","start":5.760000228881836,"end":6.300000190734863},{"word":"Crete","start":6.300000190734863,"end":6.300000190734863},{"word":"covers","start":6.300000190734863,"end":6.659999847412109},{"word":"the","start":6.659999847412109,"end":7.019999980926514},{"word":"1600","start":7.019999980926514,"end":7.659999847412109},{"word":"years","start":7.659999847412109,"end":8.319999694824219},{"word":"after","st